 font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:text-emerald-700 hover:bg-white\" href=\"/whole-building-lca\">Whole-Building LCA</a></div><a class=\"mt-2 rounded-lg px-3 py-3 text-base font-bold text-slate-700 hover:text-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-50\" href=\"/about\">About Us</a><a class=\"rounded-lg px-3 py-3 text-base font-bold text-slate-700 hover:text-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-50\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div><div class=\"pt-5 mt-4 border-t border-slate-200\"><a class=\"block text-center bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white px-5 py-4 rounded-lg text-base font-bold shadow-md transition-all\" href=\"/#calculator-workspace\">Launch LCA Workspace</a></div></div></div></details></div></div></nav></header><div class=\"flex-1\"><main class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 text-gray-800\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-green-700 mb-6\">Terms of Service</h1><p class=\"mb-4\"><strong>Effective Date:</strong> August 29, 2026</p><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">By accessing or using Green Engineering Tools (including the Embodied Carbon LCA and Smart Solar Load Calculator), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you disagree with any part of the terms, you may not access our services.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">2. Use of Our Tools</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">Our platforms are designed to provide engineering utility estimates. The data and reports generated by the Embodied Carbon LCA and Solar Calculator are for informational and planning purposes only. While we strive for accuracy using current EPD databases, we do not guarantee absolute precision. Final engineering decisions should always be reviewed by a certified professional.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">3. Intellectual Property</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">The SaaS applications, original content, features, and functionality are owned by Engr. Arsalan Khan and are protected by international copyright and intellectual property laws.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">4. Limitation of Liability</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">In no event shall Green Engineering Tools, nor its developers, be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential or punitive damages resulting from your access to or use of, or inability to access or use the application.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">5. Governing Law</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">These Terms shall be governed and construed in accordance with the laws of Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, Pakistan, without regard to its conflict of law provisions.</p></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div><footer class=\"bg-slate-950 text-slate-400 border-t border-slate-800 w-full mt-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-14\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-9 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center\" href=\"/\"><svg class=\"w-7 h-7 text-emerald-500 mr-2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" d=\"M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-black text-white tracking-tight\">GreenEngineering Tools</span></a><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">Browser-based tools and practical guides for embodied carbon, EPD data, BIM material workflows and whole-building life-cycle assessment.</p><a class=\"mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-black text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300\" href=\"/#calculator-workspace\">Open LCA calculator →</a></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Tools</h2><nav class=